"""
SAGCO-ONE - Unified Command Interface
Version: 1.0.6
Part of CMD27 Arsenal

Usage:
    sagco-one dna          # Show DNA strand
    sagco-one status       # Check system status
    sagco-one evolution    # Show evolution timeline
    sagco-one mesh         # Discover neural mesh nodes
    sagco-one oracle TEXT  # Run Guardian analysis
    sagco-one deploy       # Deploy to infrastructure
    sagco-one full         # Full status report
"""

